# Pumpkin Patrol: an original tune for the chiptune player
# Composer and arrangement: ours, 2026-10-25. E minor with the Phrygian F and a tritone (E to B-flat) for the spooky
# color, 144 beats a minute, 36 bars. A: the tune, B: the patrol march, then both again with all drums.
# One row is an eighth note. Columns: lead (pulse 25%) | harmony (pulse 50%) | bass (triangle) | drums (noise).
vol 11 5 13 8
tempo 144
